msgid "CoreMatrix"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:7
msgid "Support the following products:"
msgstr "支持以下产品："

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:9
msgid "|CoreMatrix|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:12
msgid "Supported Components"
msgstr "支持的组件"

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:14
msgid "The CoreMatrix firmware includes the following user-facing packages:"
msgstr "CoreMatrix 固件包含以下面向用户的软件包："

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:16
msgid ""
"`Module <../module/index.html>`_: The ``module`` package for M-BUS "
"expansion modules."
msgstr "`Module <../module/index.html>`_：用于 M-BUS 扩展模块的 ``module`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:17
msgid ""
"`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_: The ``unit`` package containing Unit "
"drivers."
msgstr "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_：包含 Unit 驱动的 ``unit`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:18
msgid "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_: The ``chain`` package for Chain devices."
msgstr "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_：用于 Chain 设备的 ``chain`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:21
msgid "Board Features"
msgstr "板载功能"

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:23
msgid "CoreMatrix supports the following built-in functions and peripherals:"
msgstr "CoreMatrix 支持以下内置功能和外设："

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:25
msgid "16 x 16 LED matrix output through ``M5.Display``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.Display`` 控制 16 x 16 LED 矩阵输出。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:26
msgid "Three button inputs through ``M5.BtnA``, ``M5.BtnB``, and ``M5.BtnC``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.BtnA``、``M5.BtnB`` 和 ``M5.BtnC`` 读取三个按键输入。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:27
msgid "BMI270 accelerometer and gyroscope readings through ``M5.Imu``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.Imu`` 读取 BMI270 加速度计和陀螺仪数据。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:28
msgid "Buzzer tone output through ``M5.Speaker``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.Speaker`` 控制蜂鸣器音调输出。"

#: ../../source/controllers/corematrix.rst:29
msgid ""
"Battery, VBUS, charging, and external output power management through "
"``M5.Power``."
msgstr "通过 ``M5.Power`` 管理电池、VBUS、充电和外部电源输出。"

